From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Domenico D'Arrigo <DCHEM88@hotmail.it>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 20:27:49 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] UefiPayloadPkg: Build the ESRT from FmpDxe at every boot

EsrtDxe publishes at ReadyToBoot the ESRT entries cached in its EsrtFmp
variable, which only SyncEsrtFmp() writes. ProcessCapsules() calls it,
but PlatformBootManagerLib hands each capsule on disk straight to
ProcessCapsuleImage(), so the variable is never created and EsrtDxe
publishes nothing: the OS sees the ESRT that BlSupportDxe builds from the
bootloader's firmware info, where the last attempt is always zero, and
can't tell whether an update was applied or why it failed. A synced cache
would go stale anyway: after the flash is rewritten without a capsule
(flashrom, a programmer), or while a firmware that doesn't sync runs, it
still describes the firmware that wrote it.

Use EsrtFmpDxe, which builds the ESRT at ReadyToBoot from what FmpDxe
reports in this boot, last attempt version and status included, and
keeps nothing in variables. The entry is otherwise the one BlSupportDxe
publishes: same class, type (PcdSystemFmpCapsuleImageTypeIdGuid),
version and capsule flags; the lowest supported version is the one
FmpDxe checks capsules against. Without an FMP instance EsrtFmpDxe
installs nothing, and BlSupportDxe's ESRT stays.

Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018n3yuWwDLW63F4vdf7ZFTv
---
 UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc | 6 +++++-
 UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.fdf | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc b/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc
index 9809c89e14..966d2d4179 100644
--- a/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc
+++ b/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc
@@ -1266,7 +1266,11 @@
       FmpDeviceLib|FmpDevicePkg/Library/FmpDeviceLibNull/FmpDeviceLibNull.inf
 !endif
   }
-  MdeModulePkg/Universal/EsrtDxe/EsrtDxe.inf
+  # The ESRT built from FmpDxe at each boot, last attempt included.  EsrtDxe
+  # publishes a cache that only ProcessCapsules() updates, never the capsules
+  # on disk of PlatformBootManagerLib, and that outlives a flash rewritten
+  # with a programmer.
+  MdeModulePkg/Universal/EsrtFmpDxe/EsrtFmpDxe.inf
   UefiPayloadPkg/FirmwareUpdateDxe/FirmwareUpdateDxe.inf
 !endif
 
diff --git a/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.fdf b/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.fdf
index a0330ce983..d3784ac37d 100644
--- a/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.fdf
+++ b/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.fdf
@@ -549,7 +549,7 @@ INF ShellPkg/Application/Shell/Shell.inf
 !if $(CAPSULE_EMBED_FMP_DXE) == FALSE
 INF  FILE_GUID = $(CAPSULE_MAIN_FW_GUID) FmpDevicePkg/FmpDxe/FmpDxe.inf
 !endif
-INF MdeModulePkg/Universal/EsrtDxe/EsrtDxe.inf
+INF MdeModulePkg/Universal/EsrtFmpDxe/EsrtFmpDxe.inf
 INF UefiPayloadPkg/FirmwareUpdateDxe/FirmwareUpdateDxe.inf
 !endif
 
